{"title":"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 31","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_31\">Problem 31</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 31\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In our number system the base is ten. If the base were changed to four you would count as follows: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/7/f4777c4f8a460d9c8fb7cf31ec17ddbcb7eedeea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,2,3,10,11,12,13,20,21,22,23,30,\\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"307\" height=\"16\" /> The twentieth number would be: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/c/93c1514fbd105647db1f2492653125cbeddfa9d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 20 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 38 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 44 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 104 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 110$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"412\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/0/540c019ed0681747f84912ae6556658a2ee2a023.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20^{\\text{th}}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> number will be the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/3/b532c26f181cf03bf831812413ba6217244034f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20_{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, we see\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/8/9286e58edcb29d1e12e9817b6705f799cbf5f9a2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[20_{10} = (1) \\cdot 4^2 + (1) \\cdot 4^1 + 0 \\cdot 4^0\\]\" width=\"243\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/5/3e5f2635f76d4ac2dcbf8f76190f0d4a701ca60d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= 110_{4}\\]\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>~JustinLee2017\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME\" title=\"1956 AHSME\">1956 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1956 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1956\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a 